            "text": "Unauthenticated user enumeration and security-question disclosure via /rest/user/security-question\n\nThe unauthenticated security-question lookup endpoint discloses which email addresses are registered (full question object vs empty object) and returns the account's configured security question, providing a username-enumeration oracle and reconnaissance for targeted password-reset attacks."
          },
          "locations": [
