          "message": {
            "text": "IDOR: Any authenticated user can modify or delete another user's saved address (PUT/DELETE /api/Addresss/:id)\n\nThe update and delete handlers for saved delivery addresses (`PUT/DELETE /api/Addresss/:id`) perform no ownership check. Any authenticated customer can overwrite another user's saved address — and the update silently reassigns the record to the attacker — or delete it outright. Only the read path is protected."
