              "technical_analysis": "The Complaint model's per-object handlers (`GET/PUT /api/Complaints/:id`) verify ownership, but the collection handler for `GET /api/Complaints` queries the model without a per-user `where` clause or role gate. Any authenticated JWT therefore receives all rows. The inconsistency between the guarded single-object endpoints and the unguarded listing is the root cause.",
