        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/sql-injection",
          "ruleIndex": 24,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "SQL injection — Ruled out: POST/GET /rest/track-order\n\nNo injection surface: GET /rest/track-order/:id strips all non-alphanumeric characters from orderId before use (probes `'`, `' OR 1=1--`, `' UNION SELECT 1--` all echoed back sanitized with no SQL error, no differential). POST /rest/track-order does not exist as a route in v20.2.0 (Express catch-all returns \"Unexpected path\" — request never reaches a DB query). Challenge list confirms no track-order SQLi challenge in this version."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
